---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Yosef Birri: geospatial data scientist, University of Washington Geography: Data Science, Jack Kent Cooke Foundation Scholar.">
  <section class="wrap about">
    <img class="portrait" src="/img/yosef-birri.jpg" alt="Portrait of Yosef Birri" width="640" height="800" />
    <div class="text">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I grew up in Ethiopia and came to geography through a practical question: how do you make good decisions about a
        place when the data about it is thin, scattered or out of date?
      </p>
      <p>
        That question runs through my work. At GenShifter Technologies I mapped locations in Ethiopia where public
        geographic data barely exists, working from points collected by field workers. In my coursework I've used
        nighttime satellite imagery to track urban growth across the Horn of Africa, spatial statistics to find where
        Seattle is building housing, and network analysis to measure how long it takes to reach a hospital. At Seattle
        Public Utilities I built a dashboard that brings live tide and weather forecasts onto one map for a neighborhood
        that floods during King Tides.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside GIS I've trained machine learning models in Python, from random forests and gradient boosting to
        neural networks in PyTorch, and I'm most interested in where the two meet: models that respect the fact that
        data has a location, and maps that are honest about what a model can and can't tell you.
      </p>

      <h2>Education</h2>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div>
          <dt>University of Washington, Seattle</dt>
          <dd>B.A. Geography: Data Science, minor in Informatics. Expected December 2026.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>South Seattle College</dt>
          <dd>Associate of Arts, Computer Science.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <h2>Recognition</h2>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div>
          <dt>Jack Kent Cooke Foundation Scholar</dt>
          <dd>National undergraduate transfer scholarship.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Founder, student coding club</dt>
          <dd>Organized programming activities and mentored students new to computer science.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <p class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/resume.pdf">Download resume</a>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:yosephkebede34@gmail.com">Email me</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    padding-block: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .portrait { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    height: auto; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px; filter: saturate(0.85); position: sticky; top: 1.5rem; }
  h1 { font-size: var(--s5); font-variation-settings: 'wdth' 125; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  h2 { font-size: var(--s2); margin: 2.75rem 0 1rem; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--s1); }
  .facts { margin: 0; }
  .facts div { padding-block: 0.8rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .facts dt { font-weight: 620; }
  .facts dd { margin: 0.2rem 0 0; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .portrait { position: static; max-width: 300px; }
  }
</style>
